[I] CBOR protocol implementation for C

[T] libcbor is a C99 library for parsing and generating CBOR, the
[T] general-purpose schema-less binary data format specified in RFC 8949. It
[T] supports CBOR sequences, offers a layered API with both streaming and
[T] high-level interfaces and flexible memory management.

[U] https://github.com/PJK/libcbor

